    "identifier": "release",
    "description": "<p>This technique allows the user to isolate and forcefully remove the effect of a single</p>\n<p>Genjutsu effect, so long as it can be dispelled. You must first be aware that you or your target is under the effect of a Genjutsu. As part of the activation of this jutsu, make an Illusion Check vs the Save DC of the Genjutsu. On a success you free yourself or your target from the Genjutsu.</p>",
